egory_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"cTSczU-9-cYUEM2DlNJcQw","review_id":"wLFLWsObwPPMkQS8HDCV8Q","date":"2015-01-12T19:30:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9507409930229187,"text_excerpt":"You make me miss Mid-City more than ever now. This itty bitty restaurant that can seat about 20 guests is absolutely worth a visit with a very simple menu, and delicious bites. I had never had The Fat Falafel, and didn't know 1000 Figs was the brick & mortar sister of the meals on wheels so I was a virgin to their concept and cookery. We walked over from a friend's house this sunny Saturday to this bright little spot. We were handed clipboards to peruse the small menu at the counter. I ordered the Local Smoked Chicken Salad Sandwich with Rosemary Aioli on a Semolina Loaf, and my buddy ordered the Falafel Platter with Brussels Sprouts. We both got the Hibiscus Tea with free refills. At the..."},{"business_id":"cTSczU-9-cYUEM2DlNJcQw","review_id":"Wgnnk1nEyBafyyYOGc6lYw","date":"2014-11-21T19:26:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9434769749641418,"text_excerpt":"I found out Tuesday morning that this place had opened the day before. Since I love checking out new places within walking distance, we decided to try it for dinner. OH, SO good! I had their falafel before (which I had previously found to be dry but I liked that beet-carrot slaw). But I'm glad I gave it another shot because these here perfect. Wait, let me back up. The space is really beautiful, it feels like being in someone's home and obviously a lot of careful thought went into the decor (love the silverware in drawers at each table!). It's BYOB right now but since it's next to Swirl, they're really nice about setting you up with wine and all the accouterments. It is rather quiet thoug..."},{"business_id":"cTSczU-9-cYUEM2DlNJcQw","review_id":"5ZXJZgRqyX9U2dP56VoH_A","date":"2018-06-05T04:09:49","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9403836727142334,"text_excerpt":"Came here one day for a quick lunch during my lunch break. The place was pretty small and I was worried if I was going to get a table, but I ended up in the middle of three small tables. I ordered The Platter with 2x added Brussel Sprouts and Hibiscus Tea at the counter. The food came not too long after and my platter had my table neighbors turning heads! We were all amazed at how beautiful it looked and they told me that I would definitely enjoy everything! I started off with the salads on the platter and they were really refreshing. The falafels were a bit smaller than I'm used to, but it had the best taste and texture I ever had for falafels! I also loved the fresh bread so much, that ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"cTSczU-9-cYUEM2DlNJcQw","photo_id":"o7AFd-Hf3nkv9JDAE6eQYA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/o7AFd-Hf3nkv9JDAE6eQYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9173290133476257},{"business_id":"cTSczU-9-cYUEM2DlNJcQw","photo_id":"zG1SvCV7ursESjya-PpPtQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/zG1SvCV7ursESjya-PpPtQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8912676572799683},{"business_id":"cTSczU-9-cYUEM2DlNJcQw","photo_id":"oMJvGZkgHCfORsrPwC59sw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/oMJvGZkgHCfORsrPwC59sw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8899074792861938},{"business_id":"cTSczU-9-cYUEM2DlNJcQw","photo_id":"RY_nSna0muttMf_nwZEA4g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/RY_nSna0muttMf_nwZEA4g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8837233781814575},{"business_id":"cTSczU-9-cYUEM2DlNJcQw","photo_id":"j761EoeR6qX6CSWkCz1ysA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/j761EoeR6qX6CSWkCz1ysA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8762786388397217}]},"notebook_case":null}
